{{Documentation/Header}}
<!-- Template Description -->
The '''PageTab''' template creates a horizontal tab navigation system for pages with multiple subpages. It automatically detects the current page and highlights the active tab with a blue underline, while inactive tabs appear as clickable links in gray text.

==Syntax==
{{T|PageTab|v1=minwidth=|v2=maxwidth=|v3=borderradius=|v4=height=|v5=tab1=|v6=tab2=|v7=tab3=|v8=tab4=|v9=tab5=|v10=tab6=|v11=tab7=|v12=tab8=}}

==Examples==
{{T|PageTab
|p1=tab1         = Template:PageTab
|p2=tab2         = doc
|p3=minwidth     = 
|p4=maxwidth     = 
|p5=borderradius = 
|p6=height       = 
|block=1
|_Y_ = 1
}}

